  "what_this_is": "Upper bound on every selector reading a given feature set: best arm per cell, chosen with labels. A bound rather than an estimate, so it does not depend on statistical power -- which is why it supersedes the earlier feature-association test that could not have detected a 1.8x effect on n=15.",
